    "created_at": "2020-11-10T05:12:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-10T05:12:54Z",
    "body": "We're being very careful to distinguish between interest (lots of stuff is interesting) and outright support.  If you want a clear indication of support then asking is best.  Of course, if we've implemented something, feel free to interpret that as support in the absence of other signals, but those cases are usually fairly obvious.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
